/-!
# Order checks for double-coset word 4

The 32 blocks cover every normal-form index, and check the order test whenever
its bit in the original catalogue is set. Each block has only 64 indices;
sequential elaboration bounds the memory retained by kernel computation.

Source: Parrott (1972), section 5, p.683; the parent source READMEs.
Generated by `source/generate.py`; every certificate is checked by the kernel.
-/

